			</div>



    <div id="vsb_content" class="nry-con"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #5B9BD5;  --docx-accent2-color: #ED7D31;  --docx-accent3-color: #A5A5A5;  --docx-accent4-color: #FFC000;  --docx-accent5-color: #4472C4;  --docx-accent6-color: #70AD47;  --docx-hlink-color: #0563C1;  --docx-folhlink-color: #954F72;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_5 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_2 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}p.docx_2 {  text-align: justify;}p.docx_2 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_3 {  text-align: left;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_4 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_7 {  color: #0000FF;  text-decoration: underline;}span.docx_8 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_8 p {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_8 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_9 p {  text-align: left;}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_10 p {  text-align: justify;}span.docx_11 {  color: #605E5C;  background-color: #E1DFDD;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">各学院</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">新生社区</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家助学贷款是国家资助政策的重要组成部分，对于帮助家庭经济困难学生顺利完成学业具有重要意义。根据教育部、陕西省教育厅相关通知，为做好学校202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年国家助学贷款续贷相关工作，现将有关事宜通知如下：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">一、生源地信用助学贷款续贷办理</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（一）国家开发银行生源地信用助学贷款</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.面向对象</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">以前年度已办理过国家开发银行生源地信用助学贷款，202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">～</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学年续贷学生。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">注：202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年新申请国家开发银行生源地信用助学贷款学生（含202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">级新生）可</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">咨询</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">县级学生资助管理部门确定首次申请办理流程和申贷材料。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.办理流程</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（1）学生网上自助申请</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">有续贷意向的学生登录“国家开发银行在线服务系统”（系统网址</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">https://sls.cdb.com.cn/</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）或“国家开发银行”APP，填写续贷声明，提出续贷申请。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">注：贷款学生每年登录学生在线系统应不少于2次，并更新或完善个人及共同借款人相关信息。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（2）县级学生资助管理部门审查</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生提交续贷申请后，县级学生资助管理部门开展贷前审查，与借款学生签订合同，发放受理证明。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（3）高校受理</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 22.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">贷款办理完成</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">的学生</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">需于</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日前</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">登录“</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">一网通办/</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">一站式网上办事大厅”</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">平台</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，搜索“助学贷款”模块，录入生源地信用助学贷款受理证明相关信息。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 23.2pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">具体操作流程可登录学生工作处网站“下载专区”下载查看。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 23.2pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（4）银行审批放款</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 23.2pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校回执信息录入完成、国家开发银行审批后发放资金。其中，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学宿费金额直接打款至学校账户，剩余资金留存在学生本人助学贷款账户中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">根据个人回执提交、县级学生资助管理部门处理时间不同，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">放款时间为每年的</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9—</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">11月，具体以</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">实际到账</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">为准。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（二）其他金融机构生源地助学贷款</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.面向对象</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">以前年度已办理过生源地其他金融机构（哈尔滨商业银行、各地农村商业银行、邮储银行等）承办的助学贷款，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">～</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学年续贷学生。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">注：202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年新申请其他金融机构生源地助学贷款学生（含202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">级新生）可联系经办金融机构确定首次申请办理流程和申贷材料。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.办理流程</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">由于各金融机构对续贷申请材料要求不同，学生本人可根据当地经办金融机构的要求提供相关证明材料。银行手续办理完成后，如需在办理材料上加盖学校资助部门公章，请于</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">31</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日后</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">至本科生院资助科（</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">长安</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">校区办公楼212室）办理。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">二、校园地国家助学贷款续贷办理</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.面向对象</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span id="_Hlk170984416"></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">以前年度已办理过校园地国家助学贷款，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">～</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学年</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">续贷学生，原则上需经过学校家庭经济困难认定。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">注：202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年新申请校园地国家助学贷款学生（含202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">级新生）将于</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">秋季学期</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">开学后统一组织，另行通知。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.办理流程</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（1）学生申请</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生登录中国银行手机银行APP点击“再次申请”，确认已填写申贷信息，提交贷款申请。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（2）业务审核</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校审核学生基本信息</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">困难认定情况等信息后，提交银行审核。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（3）签署借款合同</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">贷款申请经审核通过后，借款学生登录中国银行手机银行在线签署借款合同，并获取8位入学验证码，扫描下方二维码提交至学校。具体操作流程可登录学生工作处网站“下载专区”下载查看。</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 149.8pt; height: 146.35pt;"><img src="/__local/9/3E/FA/805833AE102C07563EAF48B8DEC_55A31196_1626.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/93EFA805833AE102C07563EAF48B8DEC/55A31196/1626" vheight=" 146.35pt" vwidth=" 149.8pt" orisrc="/__local/9/3E/FA/805833AE102C07563EAF48B8DEC_55A31196_1626.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 149.8pt; height: 146.35pt;"></span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（入学验证码录入）</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（4）入学确认</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生提交入学验证码后</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">将进行入学确认，完成后银行放款。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">其中，学宿费金额直接打款至学校账户，剩余资金留存在学生本人中国银行</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">贷款账户中，具体放款时间以银行为准。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">三、工作要求</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家助学贷款是帮助家庭经济困难学生解决学宿费困难、顺利完成学业的重要渠道，事关学生切身利益。请各</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">单位</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">务必高度重视、认真组织，督促学生完成国家助学贷款续贷及回执录入相关工作，做好学生政策解答，及时掌握办理贷款学生情况。202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">级、202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">级学生由所在学院负责，202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">级学生由</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">新生社区</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">负责。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">联 系 人：杨 &nbsp;帆 &nbsp;王 &nbsp;鑫</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">联系电话：81891099</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">联系邮箱：xgczzk@xidian.edu.cn</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 32pt; text-align: right;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 32pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本科生院</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
    
